am1AM12001_PLANSESSIONTURNREVIEW001DeliversTheFoundation = element "PLAN-SESSIONTURNREVIEW-001 delivers the foundation" "Activity: action" "components the HV contexts call, or their Phase 2 seams" "Activity,Action,Planned"
am1AM12001_H0Phases1To3For = element "H0 Phases 1 to 3 for the HV catalog:" "Activity: action" "requirements, interfaces and stubs, TDD with mocks" "Activity,Action,Planned"
am1BcHvStorageSchema = element "HvStorageSchema context" "Bounded context (HV work package)" "First, alone: the entities of section 12 with their migrations, the turn columns of A-11, the grade change of A-05, dump policies and the federation domain (Amendment 1, section 20.1)." "BoundedContext,Planned"
am1BcHvSharedComponents = element "HvSharedComponents context" "Bounded context (HV work package)" "Second, alone: the shared components of sections 11.1 to 11.8, each with its one test class (Amendment 1, section 20.1)." "BoundedContext,Planned"
am1BcHvReviewerPool = element "HvReviewerPool context" "Bounded context (HV work package)" "Phase H1: options and seeding, AgentIdentity, the reviewer adapters with the shared launch builder and the live-line path, the NONCE, and the reviewer queries and update (Amendment 1, section 20.1)." "BoundedContext,Planned"
am1BcHvAdmission = element "HvAdmission context" "Bounded context (HV work package)" "Phase H2: SubmitHvRequestCommand with its policies, the freeze guard, the request queries, and CancelHvRequestCommand (Amendment 1, section 20.1)." "BoundedContext,Planned"
am1BcHvExecution = element "HvExecution context" "Bounded context (HV work package)" "Phase H3: HvWorkerHost, RunReviewerProcess, the claim, start, heartbeat, append, close, fail and expiry units, incidents, the probe policies, V-1, and the HostileReview worker (Amendment 1, section 20.1)." "BoundedContext,Planned"
am1BcHvFinalization = element "HvFinalization context" "Bounded context (HV work package)" "Phase H7: HvFinalVerification, FinalizeHvRequestCommand with CommitFinalResult, and the amended foundation units (Amendment 1, section 20.1)." "BoundedContext,Planned"
am1BcHvRestSurfaces = element "HvRestSurfaces context" "Bounded context (HV work package)" "Phase H4: HostileValidationController with the error mapping (Amendment 1, section 20.1)." "BoundedContext,Planned"
am1BcHvStreamsAndOperations = element "HvStreamsAndOperations context" "Bounded context (HV work package)" "Phase H6: the two streams, the notification poll, the incident query, evidence retrieval and removal, and the read audit rows (Amendment 1, section 20.1)." "BoundedContext,Planned"
am1BcHvClientParity = element "HvClientParity context" "Bounded context (HV work package)" "Phase H5: the client, REPL verbs, MCP tools, Director commands, and the plugin verbs and watcher (Amendment 1, section 20.1)." "BoundedContext,Planned"
am1AM12001_IntegrationLiveChecksIndependentValidationOperator = element "Integration, live checks, independent validation, operator approval" "Activity: action" "" "Activity,Action,Planned"
am1AM12001_PLANSESSIONTURNREVIEW001DeliversTheFoundation -> am1AM12001_H0Phases1To3For "precedes in the delivery order" "Delivery order" "Planned"
am1AM12001_H0Phases1To3For -> am1BcHvStorageSchema "precedes in the delivery order" "Delivery order" "Planned"
am1BcHvStorageSchema -> am1BcHvSharedComponents "precedes in the delivery order" "Delivery order" "Planned"
am1BcHvSharedComponents -> am1BcHvReviewerPool "precedes in the delivery order" "Delivery order" "Planned"
am1BcHvReviewerPool -> am1BcHvAdmission "precedes in the delivery order" "Delivery order" "Planned"
am1BcHvAdmission -> am1BcHvExecution "precedes in the delivery order" "Delivery order" "Planned"
am1BcHvExecution -> am1BcHvFinalization "precedes in the delivery order" "Delivery order" "Planned"
am1BcHvFinalization -> am1BcHvRestSurfaces "precedes in the delivery order" "Delivery order" "Planned"
am1BcHvRestSurfaces -> am1BcHvStreamsAndOperations "precedes in the delivery order" "Delivery order" "Planned"
am1BcHvStreamsAndOperations -> am1BcHvClientParity "precedes in the delivery order" "Delivery order" "Planned"
am1BcHvClientParity -> am1AM12001_IntegrationLiveChecksIndependentValidationOperator "precedes in the delivery order" "Delivery order" "Planned"

